納充足，物件位於巷內，遠離車潮喧嘩鬧中取靜，根本就是抵消費高享受🤗</p><p dir=\"auto\">時間有限-先搶先贏-馬上詢問..LINE聯繫:&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://rink.cc/952h2\">https://rink.cc/952h2</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"auto\">替你省掉仲介服務費喔</p><p dir=\"auto\">官方LINE:@050ospur加入請告知租屋喔&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。\r\n本房屋近3分鐘公車站、5分鐘捷運站、5火車站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "板橋區海山路1巷", "lat": "25.0095017", "lng": "121.4672305", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "長安海山街口站", "distance": 146, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約146公尺"}, {"type": "subway", "name": "板橋站", "distance": 681, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約681公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "民族區運路口站", "distance": 182, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約182公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "板橋遠東中山店停車場", "distance": 318, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約318公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "海山魯肉飯", "distance": 42, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約42公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市板橋區海山國民小學", "distance": 328, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約328公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "海山高中校門（高中部）", "distance": 377, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約377公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "12,500元/月 (可申請租金補貼)", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "水費", "value": "平分賬單", "key": "waterFee"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "電費", "value": "平分賬單", "key": "electricFee"}, {"name": "管理費", "value": "無", "key": "manageprice"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "22坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "77年", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "無", "key": "